cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "urg-forecast-core"
abstract: >-
  Open base for forecasting Chilean emergency department demand from public
  DEIS MINSAL data: a DEIS open-data client, weekly aggregation, a quantile
  Forecaster interface with statistical baselines, a backtest harness with
  pinball-loss scoring, and a command-line tool that reports backtests and
  forecasts for any establishment.
type: software
